  "type": "module",
  "description": "Sheets editor module (UI only, LIVE engine): the Univer spreadsheet engine is mounted in the renderer and kept fully functional - open a blank workbook, edit cells, formulas, formatting, charts and pivots all work in the browser. Only the Electron main process, preload bridge and the xlsx file-IO / Rust sidecar backend are removed; those seams are stubbed via src/renderer/ui-stubs.ts.",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "vite build",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "vitest run"
  },
